~ start
match PlayerStats.curr_level
	when "start"
		if not PlayerStats.in_photo
			Max: I don’t really have any use for this now after the DS4 broke. Who watches TV these days?
		else
			Max: The DS4…
			Max: Us three used to play on this all day.
			Max: Quite sad that Martin spilled soda on it and fried the internals.
			Max: Why is it here, though…?
			$> PlayerStats.console_interacted = true
	when "messy_house"
		if not PlayerStats.in_photo
			Max: I don’t really have any use for this now after the DS4 broke. Who watches TV these days?
		else
			Max: A shame I can't use the DS4 here. I miss playing Dragon Cube Y all night long.
=> END